$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: To avoid a violent reaction, equivalent amount
of SOCl2 was dropped into the mixture of 1b and pyridine in toluene set
in an ice water bath. Under these improved conditions, the yield of 2b
increased markedly (entry 4). Compound 1b, colorless oil, yield 95%. 1H
NMR (CDCl3): δ = 7.09 (2 H, s), 4.98 (1 H, q, J = 6.8 Hz), 4.52 (1 H, br,
s), 2.25 (6 H, s). 19F NMR (CDCl3): δ = 88.68 (3 F, d, J = 6.8 Hz). MS:
m/z (%) = 238(32) [M+], 203(100), 169(41), 153(67). HRMS: Calcd:
238.0372; found: 238.0373.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
