$DATUM To avoid a violent reaction, equivalent amount of SOCl2 was dropped into
the mixture of 1b and pyridine in toluene set in an ice water bath. Under
these improved conditions, the yield of 2b increased markedly (entry 4).
Colorless oil, yield 91%. 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ = 7.37 (2 H, d, J = 8.4 Hz),
6.85 (2 H, d, J = 8.4 Hz), 5.76 (1 H, br, s), 5.06 (1 H, q, J = 6.8 Hz).
19F NMR (CDCl3): δ = 88.39 (3 F, d, J = 6.8 Hz). MS: m/z (%) = 210(39)
[M+], 175(100), 141(42), 125(67), 96(24). HRMS: Calcd: 210.0059; found:
210.0059.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
