$DATUM 1-Bromo-11-(3-methoxyphenyl)undecane (27) To a stirring solution of 26
(11.1g, 39.9mmol) and carbon tetrabromide (16.5g, 49.8mmol) in CH2Cl2
(125mL) cooled to 0 °C under N2 atmosphere, triphenylphosphine (15.7g,
59.8mmol) dissolved in CH2Cl2 (75mL) was added dropwise over 30min. After
stirring for 1hr at 0 °C, the solution was warmed to room temperature.
After stirring for additional 6hr, the solvent was evaporated by rotary
evaporation. Diethyl ether was added to the reaction mixture to
precipitate triphenylphosphine oxide and the resulting white precipitates
were filtered. Concentration in vacuo provided the crude product as a
yellow oil. The crude product was purified by column chromatography
(80:20 petroleum ether:EtOAc) to give 27 as a colorless oil (12.3g,
35.9mmol, 90%). 1-Bromo-11-(3-methoxyphenyl)undecane (27), yield 12.3g,
35.9mmol, 90% 1H NMR(CDCl3, 400MHz) δ 1.28-1.32(m, 12H, -CH2(CH2)6CH2-),
1.43(qn, J=7.2Hz, 2H, -CH2CH2CH2Br), 1.61(qn, J=7.6Hz, 2H, Ar-CH2CH2-),
1.86(qn, J=7.2Hz, 2H, -CH2CH2Br), 2.59(t, J=7.6Hz, 2H, Ar-CH2CH2-),
3.41(t, J=7.2Hz, 2H, -CH2Br), 3.80(s, 3H, -OCH2), 6.72-6.74(m, 2H, Ar-H),
6.77-6.79(m, 111, Ar-H), 7.18-7.22(m, 111, Ar-H) 13C NMR(CDCl3, 100MHz) δ
28.14, 28.72, 29.28, 29.39, 29.45, 29.48, 31.36, 32.80, 34.03, 35.99,
55.06, 110.72, 114.14, 120.81, 129.10, 144.55, 159.50. HRMS-FAB (M+1)
Calcd for C18H29BrO: 341.1480 Found: 341.1481.
