$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: To avoid a violent reaction, equivalent amount
of SOCl2 was dropped into the mixture of 1b and pyridine in toluene set
in an ice water bath. Under these improved conditions, the yield of 2b
increased markedly (entry 4). Compound 3b, colorless oil, yield 90%. 1H
NMR (CDCl3): δ = 7.59 (1 H, d, J = 7.5 Hz), 7.20 (1 H, m), 7.02 (1 H, m),
6.82 (1 H, d, J = 8.1 Hz), 6.17 (1 H, br, s), 5.82 (1 H, q, J = 7.0 Hz).
19F NMR (CDCl3): δ = 88.80 (3 F, d, J = 7.0 Hz). MS: m/z (%) = 210(68)
[M+], 175(60), 155(30), 145(60), 141(74), 127(100), 96(39). HRMS: Calcd:
210.0059; found: 210.0061.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
